      "message": "fix(ui): add the theme settings of main to theme.json.example\n\nMain added 18 geometry settings (operation tabs, browser tree,\nfont_label_min, highlight_stroke_px) and changed the dark default of\nfont_caption to 10.0. The pinning tests of the example failed after the\nmerge of main. Add each new setting with its dark default to the example\nand to the guide table, with the range from theme/clamp.rs.\n\nRefs #2025\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
